{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115095555603-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115102349\"/><p>維港泳於今日早上舉行。</p><p>維港泳於今日(15日)早上舉行，由灣仔金紫荊廣場公眾碼頭出發，以尖沙咀星光大道為終點。據了解，由於水流太急，賽事「優悠組」第四組大批參加者未下水，賽事取消，其餘組別暫時未受影響。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T02:34:16.867910+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:55:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:27:33.256291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:27:33.256291+00:00","content_hash":"7532fb96dc59ee81a1bd68e2ace8f2cd66c96beaeb5185b531d457c1f0081e38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}